  "releaseNotes": "0.6.0-preview.6: opt-in application architecture diagnostics ARC001-005, transitive profile validation, installed-package qualification and corrected aggregate documentation/examples. Namespace layer resolution handles product roots containing Web; persistence overrides cannot bypass write checks. SQLite provider requires SQLitePCLRaw.bundle_e_sqlite3 3.0.5; SQL Server provider requires patched System.Security.Cryptography.Pkcs 9.0.21. Runtime aggregate Apply semantics and existing AGG rules remain unchanged. See CHANGELOG.md.",
